# bareloop reads NO environment variable itself — `grep -rn "process\.env\.[A-Za-z_]" src/`
# returns zero matches; the library only spreads the whole `process.env` (src/ralph.js:222,
# src/kinds.js:351) as a passthrough to a spawned close process, then strips known
# credential-shaped names from that copy (CLOSE_ENV_DENY, src/ralph.js:136-153).
#
# The variables below are read by the runner/probe scripts under scripts/, not by the
# library itself:
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# USER   — the default signer name recorded on an approval/signature
# HOME   — resolving default config/patient paths
# PATH   — locating spawned tools (npm, git, tsc, …)
